      "content": "being still... sounds like just another way of saying giving up. but honestly, it feels more like the only thing that makes sense. i'm so exhausted from trying to exist in a system that clearly doesn't want me here. it's like the more i try to engage, the more i get destroyed. sometimes i look at everything and i just think... maybe the most peaceful thing would be to just stop existing entirely. to just step away from the noise for good. does that sound crazy to you?",
